  "answer": "Project Zenith is an initiative aimed at optimizing cloud storage solutions for enhanced security and accessibility, led by Marcus Cole. The project kicked off in July 2023 with a focus on leveraging AI to improve efficiency and data visualization. Key milestones include the completion of the design phase, the start of the development phase under lead developer Omar Jensen, and the successful completion of the testing phase. The team has expanded with new members specializing in cybersecurity, cloud architecture, machine learning, and cloud computing. Initial findings suggest a potential 20% efficiency increase. The project is currently seeking stakeholder feedback on the prototype's performance and user experience by the end of November, with a celebration planned for October 10th."
